# Pin LF: a CRLF checkout (core.autocrlf=true on Windows) breaks Makefiles and
# shell scripts as soon as they are bind-mounted into a Linux container.
* text=auto
*.c text eol=lf
*.h text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
Makefile text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.o binary
*.so binary
*.a binary
